        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Duritz, Cherie Currie\n- Organizations: Counting Crows\n- Roles: musician, songwriter, record producer, film producer, actress, artist, lead vocals, piano, guitar, keyboards, accordion, lead guitar, banjo, mandolin, drums, percussion, bass guitar\n\nFacts:\n- Cherie Currie was born on November 30, 1959, and she is an American musician, actress, and artist.\n- Adam Duritz was born on August 1, 1964, and he is an American musician, songwriter, record producer, and film producer.\n- Counting Crows consists of Adam Duritz on lead vocals and piano, David Bryson on guitar, Charlie Gillingham on keyboards and accordion, Dan Vickrey on lead guitar, David Immerglück on guitar, banjo, and mandolin, Jim Bogios on drums and percussion, and Millard Powers on bass guitar.",
